                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "We present a forest management map for Europe. Forest is classified in 5 distinct forest management classes: unmanaged forest, close-to-nature forestry, combined objective forestry, intensive forestry and very intensive forestry. Data on disturbance area, disturbance frequency, forest age, forest age evenness, fast-growing tree species and primary forest is used to classify forest."
